cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Pi4U in your research, please cite the original Pi4U framework
  paper listed below. Please also cite relevant algorithm publications.
title: 'Pi4U: Parallel Uncertainty Quantification and Optimization with TORC'
type: software
abstract: >-
  Pi4U is a research software framework for Bayesian inference, uncertainty
  quantification, and numerical optimization. It supports task-based parallel
  evaluation of computational models using TORC on multicore systems and
  distributed-memory clusters.
